/- [omitted from the Challenge: not used by the compared statements]
/-- **Subgoal** (Eq. (11)). Estimate (11): if `osc(ω, π_n) → 0` and `sup_n ‖ρ_{n,ω}‖_{L^q([0,T])} < ∞` with
`1/p + 1/q = 1`, then `‖f‖_{W^0_{ω,π}} ≤ C_{p,ω} limsup_n ‖M_1 f‖_{n,p,ω}`.
