/- [omitted from the Challenge: not used by the compared statements]
/-- **Subgoal** (Proposition 3.1 proof, convergence of `I_1^n`, [CF10]): for `g` continuous on
`[0,T]` and `t ∈ [0,T]`, `∑_{t_{k+1} ≤ t} g(t_{k+1}) (x(t_{k+1}) - x(t_k))² → ∫_0^t g d[x]_π`
